        "kind": "playBeat",
        "beats": [
          "I gave Holmes my reading of the old fellow, and said I knew that walk: I had watched it learned in the base hospital at Peshawar.",
          "Holmes was silent a moment. \"Admirable,\" he said. He conceded it, and the leg better than he could have seen it himself.",
          "Then he added the one thing I had missed. \"One to you, Watson.\""
        ]
      },
