        "kind": "playBeat",
        "beats": [
          "I gave Holmes my reading of the clergyman.",
          "\"Ah,\" said Holmes, very gently. \"Look again — through the glass this time. Not at his coat. At the line of his hair beside the ear, and at the book.\"",
          "I looked, and saw the greasepaint and the thin script. Holmes took the glass back to the mantel.",
          "\"You saw a black coat and stopped looking. One to me.\""
        ]
      },
