        "kind": "playBeat",
        "beats": [
          "Through Holmes's opera glass I looked across the street at the clergyman.",
          "Along his hairline, beside the ear, there was a faint brownish line upon the skin, too even to be dirt; and the book was no prayer-book but a thin paper volume in a coloured wrapper, its lines set out in short, uneven lengths."
        ]
